    "KENKO_SCOUT_SECONDARY_CLEAVER_NAME": "Toxic Cleaver",
    "KENKO_SCOUT_SECONDARY_CLEAVER_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>敏捷</style>。投掷切肉刀施加<style=cIsDamage>枯萎</style>并造成 <style=cIsDamage>{0}% 伤害</style>。对处于<style=cIsDamage>眩晕</style>状态的敌人造成<style=cIsDamage>暴击</style>并附加<style=cIsHealing>中毒</style>。",
